      "gu": "When આ armature rotates in a magnetic field, an EMF is induced in it according to Faraday's Law of Electromagnetic Induction. This EMF opposes આ supply voltage, hence it is called back EMF (આ direction of opposition is determined by Lenz's Law, but આ primary generation is due to Faraday's Law)."
