      "kn": "When load suddenly changes on an alternator or synchronous motor, ಇದು rotor starts swaying back and forth or vibrates to find ಇದು balance of its original speed. This fault is called Hunting. 'Damper winding' ಬಳಸಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ remove this fault.",
